DASH7 cabled, class = Lo-Rate channel, 10 independent recorder runs each. Window fixed at 1024 samples; added noise fixed at -19 dB wideband (+7 dB in-band), the one probed point where the honest arm sits stably between the 33.3% chance line and the ceiling. Overlap is the only thing that moves between rows: the noise realisation is identical, because the recordings are noised once and re-windowed per stride. Inflation is the mean paired difference ± its standard error.

